{"info": {"address1": "Wing-A", "address2": "6th Floor Shree Nand Dham Sector-11, CBD Belapur", "city": "Navi Mumbai", "zip": "400614", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 6266 1111", "website": "https://www.markolines.com", "industry": "Infrastructure Operations", "industryKey": "infrastructure-operations", "industryDisp": "Infrastructure Operations", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "Markolines Pavement Technologies Limited provides highway operations and maintenance services in India. The company operates through Highway Maintenance Services; and Specialized Construction Services segments. It offers consultancy services; and major maintenance services involving bituminous comprising pavement milling and filling, bituminous overlay/resurfacing, rehabilitation with glass grid, and hot in plant RAP services. The company also provides rigid pavement maintenance services for structural distresses. In addition, it offers preventive maintenance services, such as crack and fog sealing, slurry sealing, rut filling, surface dressing/chip seal, and cape seal services; and specialized maintenance services consisting of micro surfacing and cold-in-place recycling services. Further, it provides specialized construction services comprising base and subbase/soil stabilization, full depth reclamation, and tunneling. The company was formerly known as Markolines Traffic Controls Limited and changed its name to Markolines Pavement Technologies Limited in October 2021. Markolines Pavement Technologies Limited was incorporated in 2002 and is based in Navi Mumbai, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 292, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sanjay Bhanudas Patil", "age": 58, "title": "Founder, MD & Chairman", "yearBorn": 1967, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vijay Ratanchand Oswal", "age": 57, "title": "Founder & CFO", "yearBorn": 1968, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedVa